              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Haribona, umwe mu nkone zama hafi y’umwami, aravuga, at’ Ushime mbere kwa Hamani hashinze igiti c’intambge mirongwitanu z’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, ico Hamani yagereye Moridekayi, kand’ ari we yavuze ijambo ryākijije umwami. Umwami aravuga, ati Mube ari co mumumanikako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
